stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Received
  Received --> Hashed
  Hashed --> SafetyChecked
  SafetyChecked --> Parsed
  Parsed --> Classified
  Classified --> Extracted
  Extracted --> Reconciled
  Reconciled --> Dispositioned
  Dispositioned --> Completed
  Hashed --> Duplicate: same content
  SafetyChecked --> Quarantined: unsafe or suspicious
  Parsed --> Partial: parser warning
  Partial --> Reconciled: controlled extraction
  Reconciled --> Quarantined: policy or conflict risk

